will attack companies.

00:00:36.214 --> 00:00:36.880
SAM LUGANI: Yes.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.130
Let's walk through an example.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.094
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:40.094 --> 00:00:42.260
Let's say that an attacker
is targeting your company

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.750
and you're the security admin
responsible for protecting

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.746
your organization.

00:00:45.746 --> 00:00:47.120
So the attacker
is going to start

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.703
by doing some research
on your company

00:00:48.703 --> 00:00:51.290
on LinkedIn, where they can
make a list of employees

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:52.700
that they want to target.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.800
The attacker then sends
personalized emails

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.680
to these employees trying to
get them to click on a link

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:00.090
or respond with
sensitive information.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:02.300
YUFENG GUO: So what happens
if an employee opens

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.956
one of these emails or links?

00:01:03.956 --> 00:01:05.330
SAM LUGANI: Well,
let's find out.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.204
Let's say you are one
of the employees that's

00:01:07.204 --> 00:01:08.910
being targeted with
this phishing attack

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.326
and you are going to go through
your inbox in the morning.

00:01:11.326 --> 00:01:14.864
On the screen here, you're going
to see some emails come up,

00:01:14.864 --> 00:01:16.280
and you have to
choose whether you

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:19.590
think the email is a phishing
email or a safe email.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:20.840
YUFENG GUO: OK.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.120
I think I can handle this.

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:23.840
SAM LUGANI: Oops.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.629
That was a phishing email.

00:01:25.629 --> 00:01:27.170
It's hard to notice,
but you can tell

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.920
by looking at the email
domain in the From field.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.690
YUFENG GUO: So what
happens if I miss

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:33.827
